Dataset attribution
===================

This project processes the "eCommerce behavior data from multi category store" dataset,
published on Kaggle by Michael Kechinov:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/mkechinov/ecommerce-behavior-data-from-multi-category-store

Thanks to REES46 Marketing Platform (https://rees46.com/) for this dataset. The data was
collected by the Open CDP project.

The dataset page states that it can be used for free if the source is mentioned with a link
to the dataset page and a link to REES46 Marketing Platform.

No raw or derived data from the dataset is included in this repository. The file
data/sample/events_sample.csv is synthetic: it is generated by scripts/make_sample.py and
only mimics the dataset's column layout.
